  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "市場定位與創業發展",
    "sub_ename": "MARKET POSITIONING AND BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本科目的設計是讓文創EMBA同學學習行銷定位與創業發展策略。課程將帶領學生瞭解文化創意產業的市場定位以及由創新的商業模式個案分析來啟發創業發展概念。尤其從國家、產業、廠商到消費者的不同分析單位層級來學習結構化的邏輯是本科目所強調。文化創意產業中經典以及具有趨勢性的個案亦會在課堂上討論。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to deliver knowledge of marketing positioning and business development to students. The trend of evolving consensus in the culture creative industries, give pressure for students to understand the strategic and positioning issues of market. The aim of this course is to assist students to develop structure sense of culture creative business in national; industries; firms; and consumer levels of environment.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
